@startuml C4_Model_Server_Code
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Component.puml
title C4 - Model Server (ML Platform)\nДетали реализации TensorFlow Serving
package "model_server" {
    class ModelServer {
        - config: ServerConfig
        - models: Dict[str, LoadedModel]
        - gpu_pool: GPUPool
        + serve_model(request: InferRequest): InferResponse
        + load_model(model_path: str, version: int): void
        + unload_model(model_name: str): void
        + health_check(): Status
        + get_metrics(): Dict
    }
    
    class LoadedModel {
        + name: str
        + version: int
        + graph: tf.Graph
        + session: tf.Session
        + input_tensors: List[Tensor]
        + output_tensors: List[Tensor]
        + warmup(): void
        + predict(batch: np.array): np.array
    }
    
    class InferRequest {
        + model_name: str
        + model_version: int
        + inputs: Dict[str, np.array]
        + timeout_ms: int
        + to_proto(): ServingRequest
    }
    
    class InferResponse {
        + outputs: Dict[str, np.array]
        + latency_ms: float
        + model_version: int
        + to_json(): Dict
    }
    
    class GPUPool {
        - devices: List[GPUDevice]
        - allocations: Dict[str, GPUDevice]
        + allocate(model: str): GPUDevice
        + release(model: str): void
        + get_available(): List[GPUDevice]
    }
    
    class GPUDevice {
        + device_id: int
        + memory_mb: int
        + utilization: float
        + is_available(): bool
    }
    
    class DynamicBatcher {
        - batch_size: int
        - timeout_ms: int
        - queue: Queue[InferRequest]
        + add_request(req: InferRequest): void
        + get_batch(): List[InferRequest]
        + flush(): void
    }
}
package "tensorflow" <<external>> {
    class Session {
        + run(outputs, inputs): List
    }
    
    class Graph {
        + as_default(): Context
    }
}
ModelServer --> LoadedModel : manages
ModelServer --> GPUPool : uses
ModelServer --> DynamicBatcher : uses
ModelServer --> InferRequest : receives
ModelServer --> InferResponse : returns
LoadedModel --> Session : uses
LoadedModel --> Graph : uses
GPUPool --> GPUDevice : manages
note right of ModelServer
  **TensorFlow Serving API:**
  • gRPC + REST endpoints
  • Model versioning
  • A/B traffic routing
  • Dynamic batching
  • GPU memory management
end note
note left of DynamicBatcher
  **Batching Strategy:**
  • Max batch size: 32
  • Timeout: 50ms
  • Increases throughput 4-8x
  • Reduces GPU idle time
end note
@enduml